# FM Regen Notifier - seed youth intake dataset
#
# Pipe-delimited so that Notes may contain commas and semicolons freely.
# Lines beginning with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# This is the SEED only. It is written to data/countries.xlsx on first run and
# the spreadsheet is the source of truth from then on, so editing it for FM27 or
# for an older edition never means touching the application.
#
# Provenance and licensing: see data/LICENSE-DATA.md. The dates are FM24-era and
# unverified against FM26. Treat Confidence as real information, not decoration.
#
